1. Obstinate
Refusing to change your opinion or behavior.
Tamil: பிடிவாதமான
Synonyms: Stubborn, Headstrong
🧠 Obstinate = "obviously won't change!"
2. Headstrong
Very determined to do what you want, even when others advise against it.
Tamil: தன் முடிவில் பிடிவாதமான
Synonyms: Stubborn, Willful
🧠 Head + strong → strong-minded.
3. Intransigent
Unwilling to compromise or change your position.
Tamil: சமரசம் செய்யாத
Synonyms: Uncompromising, Unyielding
🧠 In + transition → won't move/change.
4. Inflexible
Unwilling to change your plans or opinions.
Tamil: வளைந்து கொடுக்காத
Synonyms: Rigid, Unyielding
🧠 Flexible ↔ Inflexible
5. Unyielding
Not giving way or accepting pressure.
Tamil: விட்டுக்கொடுக்காத
Synonyms: Firm, Rigid, Inflexible
🧠 Yield = give way → Unyielding = doesn't give way.
6. ** adamant**
Very firm and refusing to change your mind.
Tamil: மிகவும் பிடிவாதமாக உறுதியான
Synonyms: Insistent, Firm, Uncompromising
🧠 Adamant = "Absolutely NOT!" 😤
7. Dogmatic
Believing your opinions are unquestionably correct and expecting others to accept them.
Tamil: தன் கருத்தே சரி என்று பிடிவாதமாக நம்புவது
Synonyms: Opinionated, Authoritarian
🧠 Dogmatic = "My way is the only way."
8. Willful
Determined to do exactly what you want, sometimes deliberately ignoring advice.
Tamil: தன் விருப்பப்படியே செய்பவர்
Synonyms: Headstrong, Stubborn
🧠 Will → what I want.
9. Recalcitrant
Resistant to authority, rules, or control.
Tamil: கட்டுப்பாட்டை ஏற்காத
Synonyms: Defiant, Disobedient, Resistant
🧠 Recalcitrant = "Rules? No!" 🚫
10. Inimical
Harmful or hostile; strongly opposed to something.
Tamil: விரோதமான / தீங்கு விளைவிக்கும்
Synonyms: Hostile, Adverse, Antagonistic
🧠 Enemy → Inimical (think enemy-like).
